    "description": "<p><i>Reference Book: <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Star_Wars_Saga_Edition_Galaxy_of_Intrigue\" title=\"Star Wars Saga Edition Galaxy of Intrigue\">Star Wars Saga Edition Galaxy of Intrigue</a></i> </p><p><i>See also: <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Poisons\" title=\"Poisons\">Poisons</a>, <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Hazards\" title=\"Hazards\">Hazards</a></i> </p><p>Potentially causing a stroke in a creature that ingests it, Chuba Poison is derived from glands of the <span class=\"new\" title=\"Gorg (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvR29yZz9hY3Rpb249ZWRpdCZyZWRsaW5rPTE=\">Gorg</span>, a small amphibious creature found on swampy planets. </p><h2><span id=\"Chuba_Poison_Statistics_.28CL_8.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Chuba_Poison_Statistics_(CL_8)\">Chuba Poison Statistics (CL 8)</span></h2><p><b><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Keywords\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Keywords\">Keywords</a>:</b> Ingested, Natural, Poison </p><p><b>Trigger:</b> A creature ingests Chuba Poison. </p><p><b>Attack:</b> +10 vs <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Fortitude_Defense\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Fortitude Defense\">Fortitude Defense</a> </p><p><b>Recurrence:</b> None. </p><p><b>Suggested&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Skills\" title=\"Skills\">Skills</a>:</b>&nbsp;The following are suggested&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Skills\" title=\"Skills\">Skills</a>&nbsp;for this Hazard: </p><ul>\n <li><b><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Treat_Injury\" title=\"Treat Injury\">Treat Injury</a> (DC 20; Requires <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Medical_Kit\" title=\"Medical Kit\">Medical Kit</a>):</b> The character treats the Chuba Poison.</li>\n</ul><p><b>Special:</b> If the attack beats the target's <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Fortitude_Defense\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Fortitude Defense\">Fortitude Defense</a> by 10 or more, they suffer instead from a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Persistent_Condition\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Persistent Condition\">Persistent Condition</a> until three separate and successful DC 20 <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Treat_Injury\" title=\"Treat Injury\">Treat Injury</a> checks are made. </p>",
